    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p>Exposure to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> is a fear of ship personnel and soldiers alike. An Anti-Rad Dose comes in a tough hypodermic syringe. The Anti-Rad Dose grants a +10 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to the target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> against <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> and grants a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> checks to cure damage caused by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a>. </p>",
